  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 101.09 “Dam” means “dam” as defined in RSA 482:2, II, as reprinted in Appendix C.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90\n\nNew. #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-A, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8288, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8412, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10508, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13979, eff 5-24-24",
